    "resolved_findings": [
      "Header signatures precede all body checks; final callable definitions and every declared body match seed replacement semantics.",
      "Positional immutable parameters preserve arity; repeated parameter names resolve to their last slot; function calls do not consult local bindings.",
      "Nested calls own linked arguments; source-order CONS leaves initialize a fresh callee frame with zero local padding.",
      "Unit return coverage and inferred locals are distinct from Field/Bool; no magic expected-type sentinel aliases Unit.",
      "Recursive function cycles use semantic5, preserving JOB1 code4 for import cycles.",
      "Memoized graph suffix heights prevent black vertices from bypassing the maximum call depth.",
      "Stored bodies retain checked terminal flags and explicit local counts; restored binding tables are intentionally empty.",
      "Sorted reachable tables, raw dynamic apply and exact depth accounting preserve declaration-order-independent artifacts.",
      "Existing arithmetic, locals and control artifact identities remain identical."
    ]
  },
